# Reference Materials

## Purpose

Index retained external or internal sources without copying large content into project-management documents. A reference is not automatically current authority.

## Reference register

| ID | Source or path | Provenance | Relevance | Review status | Last checked |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| None | No project-specific reference registered during initialization. | — | — | — | {{DATE}} |

## Adding a reference

- Use a stable ID and real path or URL.
- Record origin, date, owner when known, intended use, and review status.
- State whether the source is current authority, supporting context, historical evidence, or an unverified lead.
- Store large retained files outside this index and link them.

## Maintenance

Update when a source is added, replaced, rechecked, loses relevance, or changes provenance.
